 "section_summary": "This section contains a Hoover cover letter and translated summaries of Japanese shortwave broadcasts from August 22 to September 2, 1941. The broadcasts report on Japan’s mobilization and diplomacy, the war in China, fighting in Europe and Iran, and Japanese claims that Britain and the United States were encircling Japan. Several recordings were impaired by static, and the August 23 program appears twice.",
